{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object, approach it, take it, inspect it, store it, move, and repeat. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = StoreObjectInCompartment    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    />",
